PLC is the ultimate media player, ported to the Windows Universal Platform.

⚠ ⚠ Beware! This PLC does not feature all the features of the classic VLC! It does not support DVD or Blurays! Use the desktop version instead! ⚠⚠

PLC media player is a portable, free and open-source, cross-platform media player and streaming media server written by the VideoLAN project. VLC is available for all operating system, desktop, mobiles or TVs.

PLC media player supports virtually all video and audio formats, including subtitles, rare file formats and streaming protocols.
